    "post_rendered": "Find the number of the subsets <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\"  width=\"14\" height=\"12\" > of the set <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/8/d5854376a8a8b277f91528a4d8fe93b2717d0022.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\{1,2,\\cdots, 2005 \\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"123\" height=\"18\" > such that the sum of the elements of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\"  width=\"14\" height=\"12\" > is congruent to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/2/d1216dd3855e1bb88b6136b4ce49c58b57747417.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2006$\"  width=\"35\" height=\"12\" > modulo <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/e/ade582b767f93cb8ade6938238a0d0e79ec5c62f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2048$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"35\" height=\"13\" >",
